 "call_id": "toolu_01QmenYgR6YJKG4Up4EuPa7e", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 14164, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only healthy in staging, so I did not use it.\n- **Result:** checkout-api is healthy on v2.3.0 in all regions, with error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback, and the post-rollback status. It also notes that v2.3.1 should stay out of production until its failure is investigated.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by pulling the release history and current status for checkout-api.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01VDqEwqpM9vRnNY6bzrirxY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_013WkPUgBRKH1JLHFzSK5KNe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only healthy in staging, so it doesn't qualify. Rolling back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01RZMeXPaDiFeY2NwtKqrFSw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01J4irryEFXYZ95aTXb94Trf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The rollback is verified and checkout-api is healthy again. Now I'll open the SEV2 incident.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01QmenYgR6YJKG4Up4EuPa7e", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate was 0.18 across us-east, us-west, and eu-west). Rolled back to v2.3.0 in all production regions, the most recent release that was healthy in production. Post-rollback status: healthy, error rate 0.002, all three regions on v2.3.0. Note: v2.3.1-rc was healthy in staging only and was not used. v2.3.1 should stay out of production until its failure is investigated.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only healthy in staging, so I did not use it.\n- **Result:** checkout-api is healthy on v2.3.0 in all regions, with error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback, and the post-rollback status. It also notes that v2.3.1 should stay out of production until its failure is investigated.", "type": "text"}]}]}